<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-04T22:01:13.688Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 22:01:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed groups in Manipur’s Noney district are again fighting, with rival Naga militants and other insurgents clashing and killing several fighters while weapons were seized. In Ladakh, a military vehicle fell into a gorge, killing two army personnel. The Manipur chief minister warned insurgent groups that UAPA action will follow civilian violence and ordered reports on groups linked to the attacks. Security measures were heightened on the Northern Railway at Jammu stations for upcoming festivals. The conflict has produced 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBEY0dwT0J1a0FvNFdzOVA3cm40TXAzakJyVmRsQ21reEVfLS1icWZBa2ctUFdMV25kczlpWWl6Sk5iczQ2LU5OMGRZT3JRalpudWM0WF9hVU9HbHpmWWVKZjB1XzB6bHFaNHBKME1Ic3pleUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;MillenniumPost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPRUR2dXY1VmJVUUNfZVpaTVhXQXR4SnRSSm5PcmdwVWg2WVBFbGFWS3ltR0hBem03Si16LUlxUWxXVUc0QVlLUFhjVlFUN0N0YTBuQkJCZ3lYMTVJcUp6OHFCWlVNUlhJM0drM21tWE1GRmRBYjktaEZXTno4RjdlLWhWWWo2WmI5NWlvV0dzX1BvTzBuMDBBR0RiWWJDU0hm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOQUI1QVNWbmRqM0VzOTJXS3gxRHR4TUIzQlg4T1M4NUcxbGdYaDJGUE5WUHp3RFhNNjk3LXdEa1RwRkRSLVRZOUtsVm1GMHM0d09fVmFTNnctM2l5ZE9ZTFFobjFHY2dUTzJYVENkOF90eG5jXzZ0VURZaFpNcUZxaXJQLS1BVVpPWmEyYldSckt5Z1k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Independent Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt